# Backend address (e.g. http://localhost:8000). If it is empty, or the backend does not answer, the site shows
# the saved results from public/demo/ (real backend exports; the check itself is not offered, the check page shows a "needs the live lab" card with a link to the saved example result) with a "The lab is not connected" notice and a Retry button.
VITE_API_URL=
# Set to 1 to always load the saved results in public/demo/ (real backend exports, except the made-up question packs in public/demo/topics/) and skip the backend.
# The site then shows a "Saved results" notice. Leave empty for a real deployment.
VITE_DEMO=
